<title>USA: IPO HIGHLIGHTS - Flat market debut day for IPOs.</title>
<headline>IPO HIGHLIGHTS - Flat market debut day for IPOs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four companies went public on Thursday with lacklustre openings. Three closed flat and one managed to claim a razor thin premium.</p>
<p>-- SmarTalk TeleServices Inc inched up 1/8 to 14-5/8 from their IPO price of 14-1/2.</p>
<p>-- Homegate Hospitality Inc shares were flat at 11-1/2 after their market debut. The company provides extended-stay hotels.</p>
<p>-- Enamelon Inc shares were flat at 7. The Yonkers, New York company is developing oral care products aimed at stopping cavities before they begin.</p>
<p>-- V-ONE Corp shares were flat at 5.</p>
</text>
